  "changes": [
    "Mobile (<=700px) layout: header bar, scrollable map-tool chips, right-side compass/zoom",
    "Mobile destination card: full-width compact grid with thumbnail; ferry phase/ports shown",
    "Joystick and E button float above bottom cards via --ui-bottom (mobile-layout.js)",
    "Two-finger pinch zoom on map; viewport page zoom disabled",
    "Destination card updates only the distance while walking (no per-frame DOM rebuild)",
    "CLAUDE.md core constraints; handoff documents updated",
